    <bpmn:process id="W_W3537" name="W3537. Packaging Waste Reduction &amp; Circular Economy" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Sustainability plan (links to VS-25); waste analytics (links to VS-73)
Frequency: Program + quarterly
Volume: Packaging waste across 205 locations
Owner: Packaging Engineering / Sustainability
Participants: Packaging Eng, Sustainability (links to VS-25/VS-73), Store Ops (links to VS-07), DC (links to VS-04), Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-34), Waste Mgmt (links to VS-73)
Source: workflow W3537 — Packaging Waste Reduction &amp; Circular Economy</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3537_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3537_Lane1" name="Packaging Eng">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3537_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3537_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3537_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3537_Lane2" name="Sustainability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3537_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3537_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3537_Start4" name="Sustainability plan (links to VS-25); waste analytics (links to VS-73)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3537_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3537_Task5" name="Packaging Eng/Sustainability analyze packaging-waste generation: corrugate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Packaging Eng/Sustainability analyze packaging-waste generation: corrugate, plastic, stretch-wrap, dunnage, and pallet waste by location/category, and identify reduction opportunities (right-sizing W3522, reusable RTI W3529, elimination, material substitution); baseline vs the waste program (links to VS-73)
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / Sustainability / BI
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3537_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3537_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3537_Task6" name="Packaging Eng execute waste-reduction initiatives: packaging…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Packaging Eng execute waste-reduction initiatives: packaging redesign/elimination, reusable vs single-use transitions, baling/recycling of corrugate/plastic at DC/store (links to VS-73), and supplier take-back; manage via the PMO (links to VS-112) where cross-functional
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / Procurement / DC
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Per initiative</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3537_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3537_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3537_Task7" name="Sustainability/Packaging Eng track waste-reduction outcomes (tons reduced…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sustainability/Packaging Eng track waste-reduction outcomes (tons reduced, recycling rate, disposal cost avoided), report to the ESG program (links to VS-25.3) and governance (W3544), and feed the circular-economy analytics (links to VS-73.3) and EPR reporting (W3539)
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Packaging Eng
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3537_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3537_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3537_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3537_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3537_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-564 (ensure controlled execution — Packaging Sustainability, Compliance &amp; Cost Analytics (PA-111.3).) | - operational: baseline and analytics; operational: program governance (W3544)
Owner: Packaging Engineering / Sustainability</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3537_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3537_Annotation9" targetRef="W3537_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
