    <bpmn:process id="W_W3539" name="W3539. Packaging Compliance Audit &amp; DENR / EPR Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Compliance cycle (links to VS-22); EPR/annual reporting (W3526)
Frequency: Annual + audit-driven
Volume: Group packaging portfolio
Owner: Compliance / Sustainability
Participants: Compliance (links to VS-22), Sustainability (links to VS-25), Packaging Eng, Legal (links to VS-100.3), Finance (links to VS-17), Quality (links to VS-31), Audit (links to VS-21)
Source: workflow W3539 — Packaging Compliance Audit &amp; DENR / EPR Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3539_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3539_Lane1" name="Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3539_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3539_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3539_Lane2" name="Sustainability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3539_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3539_Lane3" name="Audit">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3539_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3539_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3539_Start5" name="Compliance cycle (links to VS-22); EPR/annual reporting (W3526)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3539_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3539_Task6" name="Compliance/Packaging Eng audit packaging regulatory compliance: labeling…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Compliance/Packaging Eng audit packaging regulatory compliance: labeling (W3527), hazmat/UN packaging (links to VS-24.3), DTI-BPS/ICC/FDA (links to VS-22/VS-31), ISPM-15 for wood pallets (links to VS-87), and LGU plastic ordinances (links to VS-76); manage non-compliance and corrective action
Responsible (R): Compliance / Packaging Eng / Quality
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Annual + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3539_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3539_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3539_Task7" name="Sustainability/Compliance manage EPR and DENR reporting (links to W3526)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sustainability/Compliance manage EPR and DENR reporting (links to W3526): packaging-data collection (material/weight/type), PRO plan/submission and fees, DENR waste/chemical reporting where applicable (links to VS-73.2), and LGU plastic-rule reports (links to VS-76); ensure accuracy and assurance
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Compliance / Legal
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3539_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3539_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3539_Task8" name="Audit/Legal validate compliance and reporting for accuracy and record-keeping…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Audit/Legal validate compliance and reporting for accuracy and record-keeping (links to VS-88), manage regulator inspections/queries (links to VS-22.2), and report packaging-compliance status to governance (W3544) and the audit committee (links to VS-36/VS-21); track regulatory change (links to VS-22.3)
Responsible (R): Audit / Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3539_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3539_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3539_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3539_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3539_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-564 (ensure controlled execution — Packaging Sustainability, Compliance &amp; Cost Analytics (PA-111.3).) | - operational: data discipline and assurance; operational: regulatory monitoring (links to VS-22)
Owner: Compliance / Sustainability</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
