    <bpmn:process id="W_W3540" name="W3540. Packaging Damage Analytics &amp; Root Cause" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Damage/claims data (links to VS-90/VS-31/W3511); monthly analytics
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: Packaging-related damage across the chain
Owner: Packaging Engineering / Quality
Participants: Packaging Eng, Quality (links to VS-31), Logistics (links to VS-06/VS-110), DC (links to VS-04), Claims (links to VS-90), Merchandising (links to VS-01), BI (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3540 — Packaging Damage Analytics &amp; Root Cause</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3540_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3540_Lane1" name="Packaging Eng">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3540_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3540_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3540_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3540_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3540_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
