      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3540_Start3" name="Damage/claims data (links to VS-90/VS-31/W3511); monthly analytics">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3540_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3540_Task4" name="Packaging Eng/BI analyze damage attributed to packaging: damage rate by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Packaging Eng/BI analyze damage attributed to packaging: damage rate by SKU/category/lane/carrier/packaging-type, cost of damage, and the packaging failure mode (crush, puncture, moisture, abrasion, seal-failure); correlate with transit-packaging spec (W3523)
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / Quality / BI
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3540_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3540_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3540_Task5" name="Packaging Eng/Quality conduct root-cause on high-damage SKUs/lanes: packaging…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Packaging Eng/Quality conduct root-cause on high-damage SKUs/lanes: packaging under-spec, vendor non-compliance (W3525), handling/carrier abuse (links to VS-110/W3512), environmental (humidity), or product fragility; recommend corrective action (re-spec, vendor chargeback, handling change)
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / Quality / Logistics
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3540_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3540_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3540_Task6" name="Packaging Eng/Claims track damage reduction vs baseline, validate corrective…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Packaging Eng/Claims track damage reduction vs baseline, validate corrective effectiveness, feed learnings to packaging design (W3522/W3523) and vendor compliance (W3525), and report damage cost and reduction to analytics (W3542) and governance (W3544)
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / Claims / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3540_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3540_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3540_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3540_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
