        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Packaging Eng/Logistics analyze packaging cube and pallet-build efficiency: case/pallet cube utilization, pallet pattern (units/layer/layers/pallet), trailer/container fill, and air-shipment; identify low-cube SKUs and pallet-build improvements (links to W3523)
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / Logistics / BI
