        <bpmn:outgoing>W3541_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3541_Task6" name="Packaging Eng/FP&amp;A track cube/freight improvement vs baseline (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Packaging Eng/FP&amp;A track cube/freight improvement vs baseline (links to VS-110/W3516), validate savings, and report to freight analytics (links to W3516) and governance (W3544); coordinate with freight reduction (links to W3518)
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
