    <bpmn:process id="W_W3543" name="W3543. Single-Use Plastic Reduction &amp; Bag Policy Compliance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: LGU plastic ordinances (links to VS-76); sustainability target (links to VS-25)
Frequency: Program + ongoing compliance
Volume: Single-use plastic across stores (bags, packaging)
Owner: Packaging Engineering / Store Operations
Participants: Packaging Eng, Store Ops (links to VS-07), Sustainability (links to VS-25), Compliance (links to VS-22/VS-76), Marketing (links to VS-14), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Finance (links to VS-17)
Source: workflow W3543 — Single-Use Plastic Reduction &amp; Bag Policy Compliance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3543_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3543_Lane1" name="Packaging Eng">
