      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3543_Task6" name="Packaging Eng/Compliance map single-use-plastic exposure and LGU ordinances…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Packaging Eng/Compliance map single-use-plastic exposure and LGU ordinances: plastic bags, product packaging, secondary packaging, and the varying LGU plastic-bag bans/fees across BuildRight&#x27;s 200-store footprint (links to VS-76); define the compliant bag/packaging policy by region
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / Compliance / Sustainability
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager / COO
Duration: Annual + on change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3543_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3543_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3543_Task7" name="Store Ops/Packaging Eng implement the bag/packaging policy: reusable-bag…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Store Ops/Packaging Eng implement the bag/packaging policy: reusable-bag program, bag fees/charges per LGU (links to VS-08 POS), paper/biodegradable alternatives, and customer communication (links to VS-13/VS-14); manage POS bag-charge and the revenue/refund accounting (links to VS-17/VS-80)
Responsible (R): Store Ops / Packaging Eng / Marketing
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Program</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3543_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3543_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3543_Task8" name="Sustainability/Compliance track plastic reduction (bags issued, plastic tons…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sustainability/Compliance track plastic reduction (bags issued, plastic tons reduced, fee revenue), ensure LGU compliance (links to VS-76), report to the ESG program (links to VS-25.3) and governance (W3544), and manage plastic-bag levy/fee accounting and remittance where applicable
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Compliance / Finance
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3543_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
