    <bpmn:process id="W_W3544" name="W3544. Packaging Innovation &amp; Program Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual strategy; board/exec cycle (links to VS-33/VS-36)
Frequency: Annual + quarterly
Volume: Program-wide
Owner: VP Merchandising / COO
Participants: VP Merchandising, COO, Sustainability/ESG Manager, CFO, Packaging Eng, SCM, Sustainability (links to VS-25), Logistics (links to VS-06/VS-110), Innovation (links to VS-30)
Source: workflow W3544 — Packaging Innovation &amp; Program Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3544_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3544_Lane1" name="Packaging Eng">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3544_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3544_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3544_Lane2" name="VP Merchandising">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3544_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3544_Lane3" name="COO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3544_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3544_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3544_Start5" name="Annual strategy; board/exec cycle (links to VS-33/VS-36)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3544_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3544_Task6" name="Packaging Eng/Innovation drive packaging innovation: new materials/technologies…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Packaging Eng/Innovation drive packaging innovation: new materials/technologies (active/smart packaging, RFID-embedded links to VS-23, automation-friendly packaging), pilot programs, industry benchmarking, and adoption of best practice; align to innovation strategy (links to VS-30)
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / Innovation
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3544_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3544_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3544_Task7" name="VP Merchandising/SCM conduct the quarterly packaging-program review: portfolio…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: VP Merchandising/SCM conduct the quarterly packaging-program review: portfolio performance (cost W3542, damage W3540, sustainability W3526/W3538, compliance W3539), initiative pipeline and ROI, pallet/RTI pool (W3529), and EPR progress; decide adjustments and resource allocation
Responsible (R): VP Merchandising / SCM / Sustainability/ESG Manager
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3544_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3544_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3544_Task8" name="COO/Sustainability/ESG Manager report the packaging program (cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: COO/Sustainability/ESG Manager report the packaging program (cost, sustainability, compliance, innovation) to the executive committee (links to VS-33.2) and Board/sustainability committee (links to VS-36/VS-25); ensure alignment with ESG, margin (links to VS-101), and regulatory strategy and approve policy/standard updates
Responsible (R): COO / Sustainability/ESG Manager / CFO
Accountable (A): CEO / Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3544_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3544_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3544_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3544_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
