        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-564 (ensure controlled execution — Packaging Sustainability, Compliance &amp; Cost Analytics (PA-111.3).) | - operational: innovation and benchmarking; operational: quarterly governance and board oversight
Owner: VP Merchandising / COO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
